nd heavy furniture need both players to grab an end and pull together. There is no grid and nothing snaps into place: every item is moved by hand with physics. There is no score, no timer and no fail state. When both players press Done, the camera circles the finished room and hands them a polaroid that is added to an album on the menu wall and can be saved to the desktop.", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/room-movers"}